{"seq":1,"slug":"tokenization-normalization","title":"分词与归一化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/text-processing/tokenization-normalization","wordCount":1608,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"分词与归一化\">分词与归一化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分词（Tokenization）和归一化（Normalization）是信息检索文本处理流水线的第一步，负责将原始文本转化为可索引的标准化词项（Term）序列。分词将连续的字符流切分为离散的词项单元，归一化则将形态各异的词项统一为标准形式。这两个步骤的质量直接决定了下游索引和检索的效果——如果分词错误或归一化不当，后续的 TF-IDF 权重、倒排索引和查询匹配都会受到连锁影响。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始文本] --&gt; B[字符预处理]&#10;    B --&gt; C[分词 Tokenization]&#10;    C --&gt; D[大小写归一化]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Unicode 规范化]&#10;    E --&gt; F[停用词过滤]&#10;    F --&gt; G[标准化词项序列]&#10;    subgraph 归一化流水线&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[原始文本] --&gt; B[字符预处理]\n    B --&gt; C[分词 Tokenization]\n    C --&gt; D[大小写归一化]\n    D --&gt; E[Unicode 规范化]\n    E --&gt; F[停用词过滤]\n    F --&gt; G[标准化词项序列]\n    subgraph 归一化流水线\n        D\n        E\n        F\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理步骤</th>\n<th>输入示例</th>\n<th>输出示例</th>\n<th>关键决策点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字符预处理</td>\n<td><code>&lt;p&gt;Hello!&lt;/p&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Hello!</code></td>\n<td>HTML 标签移除策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分词</td>\n<td><code>state-of-the-art</code></td>\n<td><code>state of the art</code> 或 <code>state-of-the-art</code></td>\n<td>连字符处理规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大小写归一化</td>\n<td><code>iPhone</code>, <code>APPLE</code></td>\n<td><code>iphone</code>, <code>apple</code></td>\n<td>缩写词和专有名词保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unicode 规范化</td>\n<td><code>café</code> (NFC/NFD)</td>\n<td><code>café</code> (NFC)</td>\n<td>NFC vs NFD 选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停用词过滤</td>\n<td><code>the quick brown fox</code></td>\n<td><code>quick brown fox</code></td>\n<td>停用词表范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"英文分词策略\">英文分词策略</h2><p>英文分词看似简单（按空格切分），实际包含大量需要仔细处理的边界情况。最基础的空白符分词器（Whitespace Tokenizer）按空格和制表符切分文本，但无法正确处理标点符号、缩写、连字符和特殊格式。</p>\n<p>标准分词器（Standard Tokenizer）在空白符分词的基础上增加了标点处理规则：移除句末标点、保留缩写中的撇号（如 <code>don&#39;t</code> → <code>don&#39;t</code> 或 <code>do n&#39;t</code>）、处理数字中的逗号和小数点（如 <code>1,000.50</code>）。Lucene 和 Elasticsearch 默认使用的 Standard Tokenizer 基于 Unicode Text Segmentation 标准（UAX #29）实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TokenizerConfig {&#10;  readonly type: &#39;whitespace&#39; | &#39;standard&#39; | &#39;pattern&#39; | &#39;ngram&#39; | &#39;subword&#39;;&#10;  readonly maxTokenLength: number;&#10;  readonly preserveCase: boolean;&#10;  readonly handleHyphen: &#39;split&#39; | &#39;keep&#39; | &#39;both&#39;;&#10;  readonly handleApostrophe: &#39;split&#39; | &#39;keep&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Token {&#10;  readonly term: string;&#10;  readonly startOffset: number;&#10;  readonly endOffset: number;&#10;  readonly position: number;&#10;  readonly type: &#39;word&#39; | &#39;number&#39; | &#39;email&#39; | &#39;url&#39; | &#39;cjk&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function standardTokenize(text: string): ReadonlyArray&lt;Token&gt; {&#10;  const tokens: Token[] = [];&#10;  const pattern = /[\\p{L}\\p{N}][\\p{L}\\p{N}&#39;·-]*/gu;&#10;  let match: RegExpExecArray | null;&#10;  let position = 0;&#10;&#10;  while ((match = pattern.exec(text)) !== null) {&#10;    tokens.push({&#10;      term: match[0],&#10;      startOffset: match.index,&#10;      endOffset: match.index + match[0].length,&#10;      position: position++,&#10;      type: /^\\d/.test(match[0]) ? &#39;number&#39; : &#39;word&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;  return tokens;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TokenizerConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'whitespace'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'standard'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pattern'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ngram'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'subword'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> maxTokenLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> preserveCase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> handleHyphen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'split'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'keep'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--s